3
00:00:06.834 --> 00:00:07.838
Hi, Drew!

4
00:00:07.838 --> 00:00:09.394
Oh, Ben.

5
00:00:09.394 --> 00:00:11.047
I'm so happy to see you.

6
00:00:11.047 --> 00:00:13.170
I'm so happy to see you too,

7
00:00:13.170 --> 00:00:16.072
