10
00:00:22.660 --> 00:00:25.813
of "Dear Evan Hansen" and we're both-

11
00:00:25.813 --> 00:00:27.375
We're both so puffy.

12
00:00:27.375 --> 00:00:29.630
We're both so puffy and red!

13
00:00:29.630 --> 00:00:33.450
I've never seen a performance like that in my life.

14
00:00:33.450 --> 00:00:36.760
I don't know how you summoned that every day.

15
00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:39.711
