16
00:00:39.711 --> 00:00:41.760
It is, it is.

17
00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:42.593
It's very wild.

18
00:00:42.593 --> 00:00:44.930
We just made it this past fall.

19
00:00:44.930 --> 00:00:48.070 line:15%
