25
00:01:01.428 --> 00:01:03.630
It was really, really special and bizarre

26
00:01:03.630 --> 00:01:04.663
experience for sure.

27
00:01:05.530 --> 00:01:08.760
That "Dear Evan Hansen" was such a phenomenon

28
00:01:08.760 --> 00:01:10.650
