31
00:01:19.850 --> 00:01:23.150
and what comes at us and what we are born with

32
00:01:23.150 --> 00:01:26.260
and how families and how we survive school.

33
00:01:26.260 --> 00:01:30.270
It is a survival guide in the most poetic, profound way.

34
00:01:30.270 --> 00:01:31.630
And I'm so glad that it's coming

35
00:01:31.630 --> 00:01:34.010
