36
00:01:34.010 --> 00:01:36.140
This is a hand guide to life

37
00:01:36.140 --> 00:01:39.140 line:15%
and it's due to you and your performance

38
00:01:39.140 --> 00:01:41.080 line:15%
at the helm of it, truly.

39
00:01:41.080 --> 00:01:42.030 line:15%
Thank you so much.

40
00:01:42.030 --> 00:01:44.260 line:15%
Yeah, I think it's gonna be a really moving experience

41
00:01:44.260 --> 00:01:46.150
for a lot of different ages of people,

42
00:01:46.150 --> 00:01:47.689
for young people for parents.

43
00:01:47.689 --> 00:01:51.390
It's a lot about miscommunication and misconnection.

44
00:01:51.390 --> 00:01:53.230
And I think particularly after this year

45
00:01:53.230 --> 00:01:56.280
of this COVID nightmare of everybody being so isolated,

46
00:01:56.280 --> 00:02:00.068
I think it's gonna be particularly poignant in terms of

47
00:02:00.068 --> 00:02:03.300 line:15%
